title: Elections to the National Assembly
subtitle: Germany votes on 19 January, women for the first time.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1919 and month = 1 and spartacist_uprising_done = 1 and crisis = 0
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
// historical results, 19 January 1919 (423 seats; the Centre and the BVP stood together)
Q.parliament_name = 'National Assembly';
Q.parliament_size = 423;
Q.spd_seats = 163; Q.zentrum_seats = 91; Q.ddp_seats = 75; Q.dnvp_seats = 44;
Q.uspd_seats = 22; Q.dvp_seats = 19; Q.bvp_seats = 0; Q.nsdap_seats = 0;
RG.news('Germany votes: Social Democrats first, without a majority', 3);
!}

= Elections to the National Assembly

Four days after the manhunt, Germany votes for the assembly that will write its constitution. Our founding congress voted by 62 to 23 to boycott it, against Luxemburg, Liebknecht and Levi. [? if luxemburg_alive = 1 : From her hiding place Luxemburg still says the boycott is a mistake. ?] The lists close in days, and we have no candidates.

- @boycott: Respect the congress and boycott the election.
- @candidates: Overrule the congress and stand where we can.
- @vote_uspd: Tell the workers to vote for the Independents.

@boycott
subtitle: The congress decided. The Left Radicals will hold the Zentrale to it.
on-arrival: election_boycott = 1; ultraleft_satisfaction += 6; lean_ultraleft += 2

Our posters tell the workers to stay away. Most vote anyway.

@candidates
subtitle: [? if lock_elections = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] A few seats, and the districts learn that the Zentrale can overrule a congress.
choose-if: lock_elections < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids taking part in bourgeois elections.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_elections == 1) { Q.unity -= 10; Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10; }
Q.unity -= 8;
Q.ultraleft_satisfaction -= 10;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 2;
Q.election_boycott = 0;
Q.kpd_seats = Q.luxemburg_alive ? 4 : 2;
Q.uspd_seats -= Q.kpd_seats - 1;
Q.spd_seats -= 1;
!}

Lists go up in Berlin, Leipzig and a handful of other constituencies. We win [+ kpd_seats +] seats.

@vote_uspd
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Officially the boycott stands. The Independents will know whom to thank.
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids any support for social democrats.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_united_front == 1) { Q.unity -= 10; Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10; }
Q.election_boycott = 1;
Q.uspd_relation += 12;
Q.uspd_seats += 2;
Q.spd_seats -= 2;
Q.lean_unionist += 2;
!}
